%---------------- ISPF Tutorial 5 of 5: Install and Test -----------------%
%Command ===>_ZCMD
+
 Put the ULS exec in SYSEXEC or SYSPROC and all ULS panel members in
 a library allocated to ISPPLIB. Invoke ULS from an active ISPF session.
+
 Start with a small catalog level that you are authorized to list.
 Try FILTER, SORT, FIND, scrolling, and INFO before opening a data set.
+
 Validate the panel source record format, code page, dynamic-area width,
 and LMDLIST statistics at your z/OS installation. Browse, edit, and view
 behavior depends on your ISPF release and data set access authority.
+
 Enter PREV, 1-4, or END to navigate.
